# apps/owner-web — development build variant (BUILD_PLAN Phase 13 D, Constitution 6 §133–136). Copy to .env.development (never committed)
# and build with `npx vite build --mode development`, then `APS_MOBILE_ENV=dev npx cap sync`.
# Purpose: local development — a native build still needs an https API (an https tunnel / mkcert host); the web dev server proxies /api/v1 itself, so VITE_API_BASE may stay empty for the browser.
# No secret ever goes here: everything in a VITE_* variable is compiled into the app bundle and readable by anyone.
VITE_API_BASE=https://<your-dev-api-over-https>
VITE_APP_ENV=development
